// # telemetry — Metrics + Event Bus
//
// Logline: The per-process counter export (cap/PQC/AEAD/FS operations, JSON output) and the generic event bus (oo_event_emit, oo_event_subscribe) that decouples cross-cutting telemetry from the producing subsystems.
//
// Setup: metrics.c is the counter export; event.c is the event bus. metrics.c subscribes to the 8 well-known events (cap.seal, cap.attenuate, pq.sign, pq.verify, aead.seal, aead.open, fs.read, fs.write) via a constructor.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Read event.h — the oo_event_emit/subscribe API.
//   2. Read event.c — the mutex-guarded subscriber table.
//   3. Read metrics.c — the counter export; reads via oo_metrics_get, exports via oo_metrics_export.
//
// ──▓▓ telemetry ANCHOR ──▓▓──
// :: producers emit events; metrics is one of many listeners ::
